#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: simplify-admin-menus.php app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:91
#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:92
msgid "Simplify Admin Menus"
msgstr "Förenkla admin menyer"

#. Description of the plugin
#: simplify-admin-menus.php
msgid ""
"WordPress plugin that simplifies the admin panel menus and admin bar for "
"user roles or specific users."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-plugin som förenklar adminpanelens menyer och adminfältet för "
"användarroller eller specifika användare."

#. Author of the plugin
#: simplify-admin-menus.php
msgid "Adam Alexandersson"
msgstr "Adam Alexandersson"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:124
msgid "Editing:"
msgstr "Redigering:"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:125
msgid "Using role defaults"
msgstr "Använder rollens standard"

#. translators: %d: number of custom overrides
#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "Custom overrides (%d)"
msgstr "Anpassade undantag (%d)"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:128 resources/views/settings-page.php:159
msgid "Reset to role defaults"
msgstr "Återställ till rollens standard"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:129 resources/views/settings-page.php:163
msgid "This user is a protected administrator. Menu restrictions do not apply."
msgstr ""
"Denna användare är en skyddad administratör. Menybegränsningar gäller inte."

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:130 resources/views/settings-page.php:186
#: resources/views/settings-page.php:207 resources/views/settings-page.php:237
msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "Ärv"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:131 resources/views/settings-page.php:187
#: resources/views/settings-page.php:208 resources/views/settings-page.php:238
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Dölj"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:132 resources/views/settings-page.php:188
#: resources/views/settings-page.php:209 resources/views/settings-page.php:239
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Visa"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:133 resources/views/settings-page.php:191
#: resources/views/settings-page.php:212 resources/views/settings-page.php:242
msgid "Hidden by role"
msgstr "Dold av roll"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:134 resources/views/settings-page.php:151
msgid "Choose which items to hide"
msgstr "Välj vilka alternativ som ska döljas"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:135 resources/views/settings-page.php:149
msgid ""
"Set Inherit, Hide, or Show per item. Show bypasses role hiding, but cannot "
"grant WordPress capabilities the user does not have."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in Ärv, Dölj eller Visa per objekt. Visa kringgår rolldöljning, men "
"kan inte ge WordPress-rättigheter som användaren inte har."

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:215 app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:276
#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:331
msgid "Insufficient permissions"
msgstr "Otillräckliga behörigheter"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:222 app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:288
msgid "Role or User ID is required"
msgstr "Roll eller användar-ID krävs"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:231
msgid "User not found"
msgstr "Användaren hittades inte"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:281 app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:336
msgid "Invalid nonce"
msgstr "Ogiltig nonce"

#: app/Admin/SettingsPage.php:515
msgid "Settings saved successfully!"
msgstr "Inställningarna har sparats!"

#: app/AdminBar/AdminBarSettings.php:55
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Uppdateringar"

#: app/AdminBar/AdminBarSettings.php:56
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Kommentarer"

#: app/AdminBar/AdminBarSettings.php:57
msgid "My account"
msgstr "Mitt konto"

#: app/AdminBar/AdminBarSettings.php:58
msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "Kommandopalett"

#: app/AdminBar/AdminBarSettings.php:59
msgid "Litespeed Menu"
msgstr "Litespeed Meny"

#: resources/views/settings-page.php:22
msgid "Protected administrators"
msgstr "Skyddade administratörer"

#: resources/views/settings-page.php:24
msgid ""
"Protected administrators always see the full admin menu and admin bar, even "
"when the Administrator role has items hidden. Only users checked here are "
"exempt — including network/super admins. The first administrator is "
"protected by default."
msgstr ""
"Skyddade administratörer ser alltid hela adminmenyn och adminfältet, även "
"när Administratörsrollen har objekt dolda. Endast ikryssade användare är "
"undantagna — även nätverks-/superadministratörer. Den första administratören "
"är skyddad som standard."

#: resources/views/settings-page.php:44
msgid "Save protected administrators"
msgstr "Spara skyddade administratörer"

#: resources/views/settings-page.php:54
msgid "User Roles"
msgstr "Användarroller"

#: resources/views/settings-page.php:66
